1162 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Drove product strategy\054 discovery\054 user research\054 and stakeholder alignment across digital banking\054 AI\055powered experience concepts\054 cloud infrastructure\054 APIs\054 and enterprise platforms through cross\055functional workshops and iterative validation\056\n2025\0552026\nDirected the end\055to\055end experience strategy for a shared database control plane\054 unifying fragmented service operations across 10\053 database products and enabling 40\054000\053 engineers to manage services through a consistent experience that reduced cognitive load and reliance on support teams\056\n2025\nShaped Savings Goals for the Chase First Banking modernization\054 supporting the migration of 1\0565M accounts to an in\055house platform while achieving 100\045 task completion and a 4\05658\0575 ease\055of\055use score\056\n2022\0552024\nManaged a team of three designers and served as design lead for a five\055applications in the Branch Operations portfolio\054 setting design direction\054 overseeing 0\055to\0551 initiatives\054 and aligning experience strategy across products supporting branch employees and operations\056\nModernized the Branch Metrics Dashboard\054 JPMorgan Chase\047s regulatory and compliance platform for branch operations\054 cash audits\054 and operational reporting\054 reducing missed audits by 90\045 and increasing compliance attestation adoption to 98\045\056\nRedesigned enterprise KYC workflows for regulated banking operations\054 achieving 100\045 task completion\054 a 95\057100 usability score\054 and eliminating seven critical usability gaps\056)
     /K [ 10 ]
     /P 1163 0 R
     /Pg 1142 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
